    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Equifax Inc. is a public company headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia, traded under the ticker EFX. According to its website, it operates as a credit bureau, providing credit reports and credit scores to both businesses and consumers. The company also offers identity protection tools with daily monitoring and alerts, including a product it calls Equifax Complete, and says its dedicated ID Restoration Specialists work on behalf of customers who become victims of identity theft. Its site also publishes educational material on credit reports, debt, credit cards, loans, and fraud, with some resources available in Spanish.\n\nThe site's messaging centers on monitoring a person's Equifax credit report, sending alerts, and helping with identity theft recovery. The company describes its aim as helping customers focus on living their financial best, and frames financial knowledge as an asset for milestones such as buying a home, purchasing a car, or taking out a loan.\n\nThe company's SEC filing record lists CIK 0000033185. No products, lawsuits, or MCP servers are recorded for it.",
